      "text": "第四款第二号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00102",
      "target_id": "XML:2703477",
      "source_hash": "d2891e1dd4c575e3fa6d329a58902979f058e5f578a7fc5f89a697723772273f",
      "text": "信息未分别保存、管理的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00103",
      "target_id": "XML:2703478",
      "source_hash": "bcf4d912e8461d27c00be3c619ead7c46bb8c783e887baaef335bf69afe3c040",
      "text": "庚. 违反本法第二十二条第一款至第三款（包括依本法第二十六条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00104",
      "target_id": "XML:2703479",
      "source_hash": "4fa9b289130d6d54752d7283cef10eb1aa4ba80dbc6db71175a69c76611173d4",
      "text": "本法第七十五条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00108",
      "target_id": "XML:2703483",
      "source_hash": "d1e2235d3109148617d0715c370bf7a90c7a55b0ddfe10d96f3a6e3d46bba3ba",
      "text": "第八款准用的情形），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00109",
      "target_id": "XML:2703484",
      "source_hash": "8b5a7ee9214c5ff7dab6d5c2b07c1ad3939ae0af0f767f33ee1abf342f16fa21",
      "text": "第四款第三号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00110",
      "target_id": "XML:2703485",
      "source_hash": "9f59e232a5213e4248641c2e7cfd45152df81521fbbe4e3e48b3893179825a24",
      "text": "取得同意的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00111",
      "target_id": "XML:2703486",
      "source_hash": "4bf0425bcfc9fc1f786044bae8474b048b6361a126061f27771635dafe3c6da7",
      "text": "辛. 违反本法第二十三条第二款、第二十四条第三款及第二十五条第六款"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00112",
      "target_id": "XML:2703487",
      "source_hash": "4fa9b289130d6d54752d7283cef10eb1aa4ba80dbc6db71175a69c76611173d4",
      "text": "本法第七十五条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00116",
      "target_id": "XML:2703491",
      "source_hash": "768d9a0e768b01daf54c7ed0532213eea3eb830681d599c637f8834022bf714b",
      "text": "（包括依第二十五条之二第四款准用的情形）、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00117",
      "target_id": "XML:2703492",
      "source_hash": "4a86f416529d0f2ae7a86d37490331223d6287c6e3adb9e1a4be939338a7902d",
      "text": "第二款第五号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00118",
      "target_id": "XML:2703493",
      "source_hash": "133eb253165de57ef1559dfd124339555ca91a2b27e6a7c89d917aa71450e15d",
      "text": "第二十八条之四第一款及第二十九条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00119",
      "target_id": "XML:2703494",
      "source_hash": "6b636024874b295217146ee89af8539abc155c86abda71a628d298aaf11db1fd",
      "text": "（包括依本法第二十六条第八款准用的情形），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00120",
      "target_id": "XML:2703495",
      "source_hash": "00c23a4be1349a98ea179813af3e85b8c0b53b8da667482b24aa546339d95a56",
      "text": "未采取确保安全性所需"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00121",
      "target_id": "XML:2703496",
      "source_hash": "d555fac230278f35bb2b49d2bf0c6180f110562a5a5b266ae1e83d524cdc8a12",
      "text": "措施的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00122",
      "target_id": "XML:2703497",
      "source_hash": "41c1edf363f3ca1bcf1403f6ea48d60b251b74f160c7a13f362b48f894fe0f45",
      "text": "壬. 违反本法第二十三条第三款（包括依本法第二十六条第八款"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00123",
      "target_id": "XML:2703498",
      "source_hash": "4fa9b289130d6d54752d7283cef10eb1aa4ba80dbc6db71175a69c76611173d4",
      "text": "本法第七十五条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00127",
      "target_id": "XML:2703502",
      "source_hash": "9b34b07b8bd2ebf18d43c5ad29894a8b5e698e74bcbf56725bce4739d1c29708",
      "text": "准用的情形），未告知敏感信息的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00128",
      "target_id": "XML:2703503",
      "source_hash": "86d7426ab29c0d65115276c184187b706d9503bb93a072d1311e718f795f8f31",
      "text": "第二款第六号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00129",
      "target_id": "XML:2703504",
      "source_hash": "da0a6dc819bc0082da1f08e3bd580edc46cfba5c2e3ee8b388701ffb3b43998b",
      "text": "公开可能性及选择不公开的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00130",
      "target_id": "XML:2703505",
      "source_hash": "fbf2b66f4d8e77f83d8893f1f3d89a4ed87269fe16f5bb40a20da578157d0363",
